{"id": null, "n": "0430006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430006", "type": "orig", "text": "「佛如」，底本殘缺，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0432001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0432001", "type": "orig", "text": "「正」，底本作「正正」，據文意刪。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0433001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0433001", "type": "orig", "text": "「向上」，底本作「上向」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0434001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0434001", "type": "orig", "text": "「伽」，底本作「枷」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0434002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0434002", "type": "orig", "text": "「如」，底本無，據斯4678號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0435001", "type": "orig", "text": "「一一」，底本作「二」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0435002", "type": "orig", "text": "「相」，底本無，據斯4678號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0435003", "type": "orig", "text": "「一一」，底本作「二」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0436001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0436001", "type": "orig", "text": "「陀」，底本作「馱」，據斯4678號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0436002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0436002", "type": "orig", "text": "「破」，底本無，據伯2130號及斯4678號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0436003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0436003", "type": "orig", "text": "「於」，底本無，據伯2130號及斯4678號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0436004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0436004", "type": "orig", "text": "「想」，底本作「相」，據伯2130號、斯4678號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0436005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0436005", "type": "orig", "text": "「佛」，底本無，據伯2130號及斯4678號補。"}
